Homepage: https://github.com/AthenaNetworks/mymate
Description: My Mate - modern network monitor (The Dude replacement)
 My Mate is a live, web-based network monitor: it maps your network, pings every
 device for up/down, polls interface throughput over SNMP or the RouterOS API, and
 colours each link green-to-red by utilisation in real time - with alerting,
 history, auto-discovery and multi-site maps.
 .
 This package installs a self-contained instance (PostgreSQL, Redis, nginx,
 php-fpm and the background engine), provisioned automatically on install. Free
 and open source - no device limits.
